---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FitDiagnostic from '../../components/FitDiagnostic.astro';
// UTM contract: utm_content=go-fortress
---
<BaseLayout title="Own the Engine That Runs Your Growth | Buildwise Media" description="See the ownership difference between a rented agency setup and a custom AI engine installed for your business." noindex={true}>
<main>
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">The Fortress · Ownership before tactics</p><!-- @bwm-exp-slot: hero-headline --><h1 data-bwm-exp-slot="hero-headline">Stop building your business on rented land.</h1><p class="deck">Most agencies build you a rented house on someone else's land. We build you a fortress on your own soil.</p><div class="ctas"><!-- @bwm-exp-slot: hero-cta --><a class="cta" href="#diagnostic" data-cta-source="fortress-hero-primary" data-bwm-exp-slot="hero-cta">Get My Free Revenue Leak Map <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="cta-ghost" href="/book" data-cta-source="fortress-hero-secondary">See If We're a Fit</a></div><p class="qual mono">For established service businesses with real revenue. Owners looking for a savior bounce off — and that is the right outcome.</p></div>
  <!-- @r020:F1 emotion: the system architecture image makes ownership feel physical and supports the fortress metaphor without false security claims -->
  <figure><img src="/images/bwm-system-architecture-atmospheric-v1.webp" alt="A dark architectural structure lit with sharp yellow lines" width="640" height="426" loading="eager" decoding="async"/><figcaption class="mono">A business asset built around your operation.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
  <section class="compare"><div class="container"><p class="section-tag">THE OWNERSHIP TEST</p><h2>Ask what is yours the day you leave.</h2><p class="lede">Agency terms vary. Read your own contract. These are the questions owners should settle before they sign.</p><div class="table" role="table" aria-label="Typical agency arrangement compared with the Buildwise install"><div class="row head" role="row"><span>AXIS</span><span>TYPICAL RENTED ARRANGEMENT</span><span>THE BWM INSTALL</span></div><div class="row"><strong>Code</strong><span>Often tied to the provider's platform or account.</span><span>You own the custom code we deliver.</span></div><div class="row"><strong>Data and customer list</strong><span>Access may depend on the provider and its export rules.</span><span>Your business keeps its data and customer list.</span></div><div class="row"><strong>Ad accounts</strong><span>The provider may hold the account or key access.</span><span>Your business owns and controls its ad accounts.</span></div><div class="row"><strong>The day you leave</strong><span>Services and access may stop with the contract.</span><span>You keep the installed engine and delivered assets.</span></div><div class="row"><strong>Terms</strong><span>Long terms and exit limits are common contract risks.</span><span>Month-to-month after day 90.</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="future"><div class="container"><p class="section-tag">TWO PATHS</p><div class="paths"><article><span class="num mono">01 · RENT</span><h2>The business keeps borrowing its edge.</h2><p>Each new tool adds another handoff. The owner stays the router. Leaving may mean rebuilding the system, the history, or both.</p></article><article class="owned"><span class="num mono">02 · OWN</span><h2>The business builds an asset.</h2><p>The engine keeps its learning inside your operation. Our dedicated engineering team builds, maintains, and monitors it. Your team gains leverage without giving up control.</p></article></div>
  <!-- @r020:F2 proof: the ownership split diagram turns the two future paths into a clear visual choice -->
  <figure class="fork"><svg viewBox="0 0 760 190" role="img" aria-label="One path rents disconnected tools while the other builds an owned engine"><path d="M70 95H290M290 95 470 42M290 95l180 53"/><circle cx="70" cy="95" r="8"/><circle class="hot" cx="470" cy="42" r="8"/><circle cx="470" cy="148" r="8"/><text x="28" y="75">TODAY</text><text x="500" y="47">OWNED ENGINE · COMPOUNDS</text><text x="500" y="153">RENTED TOOLS · RESET RISK</text></svg><figcaption class="mono">The contract decides which path is real.</figcaption></figure>
  <div class="trust"><strong>5× attributable ROI inside 24 months</strong><span>Contractual floor</span><strong>True month-to-month after day 90</strong><span>No long lock-in</span></div><div class="final"><h2>Own the engine. Keep the option to leave.</h2><a class="cta-ghost" href="/book" data-cta-source="fortress-final-secondary">See If We're a Fit</a></div></div></section>
  <FitDiagnostic />
</main></BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{padding:clamp(96px,11vw,160px) 0 80px}.hero-grid{display:grid;gap:48px;align-items:center}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,76px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em}.deck{font-size:clamp(20px,2.5vw,27px);line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink-dim);max-width:760px}.ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}.qual{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-faint);line-height:1.6;max-width:660px}figure img{width:100%;display:block}figcaption{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:10px}.compare,.future{padding:clamp(64px,8vw,112px) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}.compare{background:var(--bg-elev)}h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.5vw,52px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:20px 0}.lede,.paths p{color:var(--ink-dim);font-size:18px;line-height:1.65}.table{margin-top:40px;border:1px solid var(--rule)}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);gap:10px}.row:last-child{border:0}.row span{color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.5}.row span:last-child{color:var(--ink)}.head{font:700 10px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#F0FF00}.paths{display:grid;gap:1px;background:var(--rule);margin-top:36px}.paths article{background:var(--bg);padding:clamp(28px,4vw,48px)}.paths .owned{box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #F0FF00}.num{color:#F0FF00;font-size:11px}.fork{overflow:auto;margin:50px 0}.fork svg{min-width:700px;width:100%}.fork path{fill:none;stroke:#62626A;stroke-width:2}.fork circle{fill:#62626A}.fork .hot{fill:#F0FF00}.fork text{fill:#EDEDF0;font:11px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace}.trust{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:8px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding:28px 0}.trust strong{color:#F0FF00}.trust span{color:var(--ink-dim)}.final{margin-top:64px}@media(min-width:900px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr}.row{grid-template-columns:.7fr 1fr 1fr}.paths{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
</style>
